# Redirects in the portable format read by Cloudflare Pages, kept equivalent to
# netlify.toml so either host behaves the same.
#
# WARNING, and the reason the publish directory matters more than this file:
# both Netlify and Cloudflare Pages serve a real file in preference to a rule
# like these. Blocking an internal path only works while someone remembers to
# add it here. Deploying a directory that never contains internal files is the
# only version of this that cannot rot — see the publish-directory note in
# HANDOFF.md.

# Pretty URLs for the three trackers that get shared in chat.
/sky         /tools/sky-ledger.html        301
/races       /tools/race-unlocks.html      301
/calculator  /tools/combo-calculator.html  301

# The campaign plate was withdrawn. It had been published and indexed, so send
# its old URL to the dungeon index rather than leaving a dead end.
/dungeons/campaign-10-to-50.html  /dungeons/index.html  301

# Our own Plane of Sky tracker was withdrawn on 17 Aug 2026 and replaced by Sky
# Ledger, which spends a held turn-in piece once instead of counting it against
# every test that wants it. The old URL was published, indexed and shared in
# chat, so it goes to the tool that replaced it rather than to a dead end. There
# is no tombstone page: the withdrawal is recorded in the change log, which is
# where removals belong.
/tools/plane-of-sky.html  /tools/sky-ledger.html  301

# The blacklist that used to sit here is gone. It listed ten internal paths
# and blocked them by rule, which only ever worked while someone remembered
# to add the next one. public/ is the deploy root and contains nothing
# internal, so there is nothing left to block.

# The five navigation-map pages were withdrawn 17 Aug 2026. Every survey now
# carries a floor plan drawn from the game's own mesh, so a second hand-made
# map of the same zone was a worse copy of something already on the page.
# Redirected rather than 404'd: they were linked from the dungeon index for
# weeks and someone will have one open.
/dungeons/najena-map.html        /dungeons/najena.html        301
/dungeons/splitpaw-map.html      /dungeons/splitpaw.html      301
/dungeons/lowerguk-map.html      /dungeons/lowerguk.html      301
/dungeons/nagafenslair-map.html  /dungeons/nagafenslair.html  301
/dungeons/mistmoore-map.html     /dungeons/mistmoore.html     301
